    "steam_appid": 2976600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Deathland Drifters is a 1-6 player co-op roguelike about piloting a hovership across a doomed alien planet. An endless rain of space debris has shattered civilization on this once thriving colony world and transformed it into a hellscape. Your crew of Drifters are stranded on this desolate planet, but one spaceship, miraculously intact, could be your last shot at escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you fight your way through handcrafted environments, you can scavenge loot to upgrade your ship and weapons, creating unique builds for each run. Each weapon has a unique upgrade tree, and randomized loot can be combined to create unique builds for your ship!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pick the hovership that best suits your playstyle and needs! Most hoverships can accommodate up to 6 players, but a select few compact hoverships are specially designed for 1-2 players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each hovership has its own set of weapons, abilities, and playstyles. Create different layouts or unlock new hoverships to keep every run fresh and entertaining.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/7e3b5cb70f72dbb88e125effa86d2e7c.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Deathland Drifters is a 1-6 player co-op roguelike about piloting a hovership across a doomed alien planet. An endless rain of space debris has shattered civilization on this once thriving colony world and transformed it into a hellscape. Your crew of Drifters are stranded on this desolate planet, but one spaceship, miraculously intact, could be your last shot at escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/4872135857592713d858fbababeb3196.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you fight your way through handcrafted environments, you can scavenge loot to upgrade your ship and weapons, creating unique builds for each run. Each weapon has a unique upgrade tree, and randomized loot can be combined to create unique builds for your ship!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/faface163c438b5fbf7f3389082f60de.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pick the hovership that best suits your playstyle and needs! Most hoverships can accommodate up to 6 players, but a select few compact hoverships are specially designed for 1-2 players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.poster.avif?t=1721339535\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.webm?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976600/extras/d860fd3839e4aba57c25782cadcedecd.mp4?t=1721339535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each hovership has its own set of weapons, abilities, and playstyles. Create different layouts or unlock new hoverships to keep every run fresh and entertaining.",
    "short_description": "Pilot a hovership across a doomed alien planet in this co-op roguelike FPS for 1-6 players. Master each hovership's unique playstyles, scavenge loot to create different builds, and work together with your crew of Drifters to fight your way off world.",
